    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ahoy!</strong> is a thrilling fantasy survival adventure set in the golden age of piracy. After a fierce storm wrecks your ship, you wash ashore on an uncharted and mysterious island teeming with magic, strange creatures, and dark, demonic forces. With nothing but your instincts, you must craft, build, and fight to survive in this dangerous new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island's secrets and uncover ancient, mystical powers. From gathering resources and constructing your stronghold to facing fearsome enemies and unearthly monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200530/extras/26a3eca782c787f3831a5580a1455bfe.avif?t=1732472432\" data-has-big width=800 height=68 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival &amp; Exploration:</strong> Scavenge, hunt, and craft to stay alive while exploring the vast, untamed island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200530/extras/0ff5dffb7242ead31edff6c7abbe2d9d.avif?t=1732472432\" data-has-big width=800 height=68 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat:</strong> Engage in tough combat with hostile creatures, and dark entities. Use what you can find and craft to defend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200530/extras/3c337a947c5b263df22a9f98d36711ef.avif?t=1732472432\" data-has-big width=800 height=68 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Building:</strong> Gather resources to build shelters, craft weapons, and fortify your base against growing threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200530/extras/6f1a3452dc80c769e810957f459c3528.avif?t=1732472432\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World:</strong> The island is ever-changing with dynamic weather, day-night cycles, and evolving threats that challenge your survival instincts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mighty Bosses:</strong>\u00a0Battle epic, supernatural bosses with devastating powers. Defeat them to unlock powerful artifacts, and new areas of the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystical Forces:</strong> Discover ancient magic and dark secrets that can change the tide of your journey. Will you wield these powers, or will they consume you?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to set sail into the unknown and conquer the island in <strong>Ahoy!</strong>\u2014where danger, magic, and adventure await! </p>",
